note one tool call: command region c, output region o (exit 0), call index i
fn sgcall c ulong o ulong i ulong to void
sgotx sga3
sgonum get sgst 6
sgoc 95
sgonum i
sgotx sga4
sgclr RG
sgtx RG sgarg0
sgcer RG c
sgtx RG sgarg1
sgoer RG
sgotx sga5
sgclr RTR
sgtx RTR sgtr0
sgcer RTR o
sgtx RTR sgtr1
sgoer RTR
sgotx sga6
sgonum get sgst 6
sgoc 95
sgonum i
sgotx sga7
end

fn sgonum v ulong to void
if ge v 10
sgonum div v 10
end
sgoc uchar add rem v 10 48
end

note conversation number sgst 6: world task header, family, templates, pattern, JSON line
fn sgconv to void
sgenv
f = sgr 10
sgwtx sgttask
sgwc 115
sgwnum get sgst 6
sgwc 32
sgwfam f
sgwtx sgttrain
