fn sgwnum v ulong to void
if ge v 10
sgwnum div v 10
end
sgwc uchar add rem v 10 48
end

fn sgwfam f ulong to void
sgclr RT
sgw RT sgfams f
sgwr RT
end

note the JSON line; pattern p: 0 action, 1 action && verify, 2 action then verify, 3 inspect
note then action (families with an inspect command; else as 0)
fn sgemit p ulong to void
sgotx sga1
sgsysa
sgoer RHH
soesc sgq2
